', 'total = (5 + 3)
print(total)
', 'script', NULL, 'Bracket matching works both ways - too many closing brackets is just as much a mismatch as too few, Python just notices it differently (there''s nothing left open to match).', 'Count brackets in both directions: enough opens for every close, and no closes left over.', NULL, 'published', 'e1930bd27b9747e37b04c74b7802f08b77a3a059c10b914247f7696373282100', NOW());
