Example: `total_cost(3, 10)` should return `30`.', 'def total_cost(items, price_per_item):
    return items
', 'def total_cost(items, price_per_item):
    return items * price_per_item
', 'function', 'total_cost', 'If a function''s result never changes no matter what you pass for one of its parameters, that parameter probably isn''t being used in the calculation at all - a strong sign a step was simply left out.', 'Try varying each parameter independently - if the result never changes, that parameter is being ignored.', NULL, 'published', '24bd011e02f6a07828d041b2a8749697f8017d8d30dc12bf291341d9fd48e7a9', NOW());
