Example: `bonus_eligible(10)` should return `True`.', 'def bonus_eligible(years_worked):
    return years_worked > 5
', 'def bonus_eligible(years_worked):
    return years_worked >= 5
', 'function', 'bonus_eligible', '"Or more" / "or above" / "at least" are all inclusive phrases - they need `>=`, not `>`. "More than" / "over" / "above" are the exclusive versions that actually need `>`.', 'Check a brief''s exact wording - "at least N" needs `>=`; "more than N" needs `>`.', NULL, 'published', '03cbdc4a47ea96d04662b47bc25e8c48e47b851c2b651ed4023b777db2f42541', NOW());
